+      # `Secure` attribute on the wa_access / wa_refresh cookies. A browser
+      # refuses to store a Secure cookie on a plain-http origin (an IP:port with
+      # no TLS), so login succeeds and the very next page still looks logged
+      # out — "Your session has expired. Please log in again."
